  oracle rakupp-3.14.0 → -0.3010299956639812e0
  verdict impl-bug
  why    the correctly-rounded double for log10(0.5) is -0.3010299956639812; the reference is one ULP out
  ruled  2026-08-16 against rakudo-2026.07

